                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Happy path </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>-  agent searched for one template and used it in sent message without altering</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Template browsing</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> - agent selected couple of templates before using one of them in sent message without altering</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Template altering</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> -  agent searched for one template and used it in sent message, but had altered the template</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Template browsing &amp; altering</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> - agent selected couple of templates before using one of them in sent message, and had altered the template</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Paste only </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>- agent didn’t search for any templates and sent a message using paste option</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Fallback to paste</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'> - agent browsed templates but in the end sent a message using paste option </run>
